Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 00:57:53 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] perf(web): drop dead logo-original.png and bump SW cache to
 v4
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

logo-original.png (1.8MB) was referenced nowhere in src/ — only listed in
sw.js CACHE_FIRST_PATHS — so first installs cached 1.8MB of dead weight.
Remove the file and its SW entry; bump CACHE_VERSION to v4 so activate
cleans the old v3 cache containing it.
---
 packages/client/public/logo-original.png | Bin 1078047 -> 0 bytes
 packages/client/public/sw.js             |   6 +++---
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 packages/client/public/logo-original.png

diff --git a/packages/client/public/logo-original.png b/packages/client/public/logo-original.png
deleted file mode 100644
